\section{Ablations and Additional Analytical Investigations}
\label{sec:post-results-investigations}

The preceding sections define the deployed estimator and present its primary
comparative evidence.  The material below records coefficient-law and
model-mismatch ablations together with the optional full-state physical-error
formulation.  These studies explain how the present design was reached, expose
residual error that survives ideal sensor inputs, and identify where the
reduced model is limited; they are not required to understand the deployed
adaptation law.

